<p>During the three months ended June 30, 1996, the company incurred a nonrecurring special severance charge related to the resignation of a former officer.  Excluding such special severance charge from the year ended Dec. 31, 1996, income from operations would have been $3,204,000, net income would have been $2,634,000, and net income per common and common equivalent share would have been $0.64. (2) Calculated as income before income taxes less proforma income taxes at a 39% rate, divided by shares used in computing net income per common and common equivalent share.</p>
